WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Create one customer identity with your phone. Email is not required.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Use the delivered code before expiry. Never share it.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Your new account has no purchases yet. Store balances remain separate.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Recover an existing account using its phone or email.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
A neutral acknowledgement does not confirm account existence. After reset, sign in again.
